OL,3,GNEWSAFlights cancelled in ongoing
OL,4,Aindustrial action
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights have been cancelled at a city
OL,7,Fairport while it is closed to air
OL,8,Ftraffic as part of ongoing industrial
OL,9,Faction.
OL,11,FAir traffic control members in the
OL,12,FProspect union at Norwich Airport voted
OL,13,Fin favour of action from 17 August in
OL,14,Frelation to pay and conditions, which
OL,15,Fhas seen staff working strictly to
OL,16,Fcontracted hours.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
