OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFlights cancelled in ongoing
OL,4,Aindustrial action
OL,5,
OL,6,FCustomers had already been advised to
OL,7,Fcheck with their airline ahead of
OL,8,Fflying, however, on Thursday the
OL,9,Fairport said the site would be closed
OL,10,Fto air traffic between 08:00 and 13:00
OL,11,FBST on Friday.
OL,13,FA spokesperson for the airport
OL,14,Fapologised for any convenience, adding:
OL,15,F"Discussions with Prospect are
OL,16,Fcontinuing and we remain committed to
OL,17,Fresolving the dispute."
